card.statement:
The elements

\begin{equation}
\begin{array}{rl}
\left\{S_{i,j}^{(r)} \:\Big|\: i,j \in \mathcal{I}_n, r > l\right\}_{\phantom{S}}
& \text{if $l$ is even;} \\  \\
\left\{ S_{i,j}^{(r)} +\frac{\phi}{2}S_{i,j}^{(r-1)}\: \Big| \: i,j \in \mathcal{I}_n,
r > l\right\}_{\phantom{S}} & \text{if $l$ is odd}
\end{array}
\end{equation}

generate the kernel of $\kappa_l$.
